OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 86, dies in crash between car
OL,4,Aand van in Highlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 86-year-old man has died in a
OL,7,Ftwo-vehicle crash in the Highlands.
OL,9,FThe collision happened on the A9 at
OL,10,FTarlogie near Tain at about 17:15 on
OL,11,FSaturday and involved a white Peugeot
OL,12,F208 and a white Renault Master Luton
OL,13,Fvan.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended but the
OL,16,FPeugeot driver was pronounced dead at
OL,17,Fthe scene. The van driver was taken to
OL,18,Fhospital with injuries that were not
OL,19,Flife-threatening.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
